  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From Crisis to Transformation: Women&#x2019;s Organizations for a Just and Inclusive Ukraine, 2026-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Increased participation and decision-making agency of Ukrainian Women-Led and Women&#x2019;s Rights Organizations in the Reconstruction and EU accession processes.

2.	An enabling environment for WROs and WLOs fostering collaboration for more impactful influence on Reconstruction and EU accession processes.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall project goal is to promote a strong, diverse, and inclusive civil society in Ukraine where women-led and women&#x2019;s rights organizations can shape a gender-sensitive, democratic and rights-based national reconstruction and EU accession.</narrative>
  </description>
